OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to increase security at RNLI
OL,4,Acentre after abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FSecurity improvements have been
OL,7,Fproposed at an RNLI Lifeboat Support
OL,8,FCentre, after the charity came under
OL,9,Ffire for its role in rescuing small
OL,10,Fboat migrants.
OL,12,FThe plans, submitted to Bournemouth,
OL,13,FChristchurch and Poole (BCP) Council,
OL,14,Finclude a new entrance lobby at the
OL,15,Fsite on West Quay Road in Poole.
OL,17,FLast month, the 202-year-old rescue
OL,18,Fcharity said its volunteers had been
OL,19,Ftargeted by anti-migrant protesters
OL,20,Fafter two lifeboats were involved in an
OL,21,Foperation in the English Channel.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
